     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hello Phil,<br><br><br>I observed that when I am changing the order of items specified, the corresponding plots are changing.<br><br>Is it necessary that which.items elements should be in order?<br><br><br>For e.g.<div><br></div><div>data(LSAT7)<br>data=expand.table(LSAT7)</div><div>modL &lt;- mirt(data, 1)</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>plot(modL, type = &#39;infotrace&#39;, which.items=c(2, 3,4,5))</div><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-DmHN5SJb7xg/VX_BgqJ_YMI/AAAAAAAAA84/nS8XaXEBu5M/s1600/plot4.jpg\" style=\"clear:left;margin-bottom:1em;float:left;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-DmHN5SJb7xg/VX_BgqJ_YMI/AAAAAAAAA84/nS8XaXEBu5M/s1600/plot4.jpg&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792475601362000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3EQNCAI0IVGFTfz-t5h13g\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-DmHN5SJb7xg/VX_BgqJ_YMI/AAAAAAAAA84/nS8XaXEBu5M/s320/plot4.jpg\" border=\"0\" width=\"320\" height=\"217\" alt=\"4 plots ordered\"></a></p><div><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-pUUkebq-tzo/VX_BnATtoeI/AAAAAAAAA9A/Wi0rGAdotwM/s1600/plot5order.jpg\" style=\"clear:left;margin-bottom:1em;float:left;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-pUUkebq-tzo/VX_BnATtoeI/AAAAAAAAA9A/Wi0rGAdotwM/s1600/plot5order.jpg&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792475601362000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2E64MQdXOCaoCDAOniiJis\"><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);text-align:start\">plot(modL, type = &#39;infotrace&#39;, which.items=c(1,2, 3,4,5))</span><br></a><a href=\"https://lh3.googleuse